---
import Layout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Section from "@/components/wrapper/Section.astro";
import ArticleBody from "@/components/content/ArticleBody.astro";
import Button from "@/components/Button.astro";
---

<Layout
  theme="dark"
  title="Privacy"
  description="What this site records about visitors, and how to change your choice."
>
  <Section paddingTop="small" paddingBottom="large">
    <ArticleBody title="Privacy" backLabel="Back" backHref="/">
      <p>
        You can read everything on this site without giving us any information
        about yourself. There are no accounts, no forms and no advertising.
      </p>

      <h2>Who runs this site</h2>
      <p>
        The website is run by, and your data is controlled by, Peter Varga,
        Bratislava, Slovakia. Contact:
        <a href="mailto:info@pictusweb.sk">info@pictusweb.sk</a>
      </p>
      <p>
        The website serves educational purposes only. It is run by a private
        individual, not by a registered church or a company.
      </p>

      <h2>Anonymous analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We would like to know which pages are read, so that we can see what is
        useful. For this we use an analytics tool that we run ourselves at
        analytics.pictusweb.com. It is not shared with advertising companies.
      </p>
      <p>
        The tool starts only if you choose Accept in the bar at the bottom of
        the page. If you decline, or do not answer, it is never loaded.
      </p>
      <p>When it runs, it records:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>which page was opened and when</li>
        <li>the site you came from, if any</li>
        <li>your browser, operating system and type of device</li>
        <li>your language and country</li>
        <li>technical errors that happen on a page</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        It does not record your name, your email address or anything you type.
        It sets no cookies, and it does not follow you to other websites. We
        cannot tell from it who you are.
      </p>

      <h2>What is stored in your browser</h2>
      <p>
        This site sets no cookies. To remember whether you accepted or declined
        analytics, it keeps one small entry in your browser’s local storage. It
        stays on your device and is not sent to us.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choice</h2>
      <p>
        Analytics runs only with your consent, as the General Data Protection
        Regulation (GDPR) requires, and you can change your mind at any time.
        The button below brings the bar back.
      </p>
      <p>
        <Button emphasis="secondary" data-consent-reset>
          Change my choice
        </Button>
      </p>

      <h2>Hosting</h2>
      <p>
        The site is hosted with a hosting provider in the European Union. Like
        any web server, it keeps standard access logs for security, which
        include the IP address of each request. The fonts are served from this
        site, not from a third party.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under the GDPR you may ask what data is held about you, ask for it to be
        corrected or deleted, and complain to your data protection authority. To
        use any of these rights, write to{" "}
        <a href="mailto:info@pictusweb.sk">info@pictusweb.sk</a>.
      </p>
    </ArticleBody>
  </Section>
</Layout>
